      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying a heavy weight of self-judgment, and that feeling of not belonging is so incredibly isolating. Those thoughts about 'rot' are just your mind trying to find a reason to keep you stuck in this pain. Instead of trying to fix yourself for others, maybe you could just let yourself be a little kinder to the person who is hurting right now. You deserve to find a way to feel less alone in this.",
